## Project Structure

```
.cursor/   # agents/, rules/, skills/, hooks/, mcp.json
.space/    # missions/<id>/, archive/, roadmaps/
DESIGN.md  # house look / tokens (UI globs → 150-design.mdc)
```

Schemas: `docs/mission-artifacts.md`. Agent models: `.cursor/agents/*.md` SoT (ignore gitignored `.space/models.toml`). Visual UI: read root `DESIGN.md` via `150-design.mdc` before generating components.

## Branches / Commits

- Work on `feat/<id>/<title>` (never `main`). Before ship merge: rename to `feat/<title>`.
- Conventional Commits; 1-3 per branch (max 5); rebase on `main` → `git merge --no-ff`.
- No mission ids (`M…`) in commit subjects/bodies.

## Mission IDs

`M` + base36 ms since 2026-01-01:

```
node -e "const MS=Date.now()-new Date('2026-01-01').getTime();console.log('M'+MS.toString(36).toUpperCase())"
```

## Artifacts / evidence

Mission dir: `mission.json`, `spec.md`, `plan.json`, `evidence.jsonl`, optional `decisions.md` / `questions.md` / `review.json`. Roadmaps via `spacecraft map`. Findings: fix in `/sc-run` and report in summary. Ready/ship: 0 review findings.

```
spacecraft evidence <label> -- <command>
spacecraft evidence --mission <id> <label> -- <command>
```

Alias `evi`. Evidence stdout must be real - never fabricated.

## Standards / git safety

- ASCII hyphen-minus (`-`) only. Reproduce bugs E2E before fix. Fix lint/test/flake even if unrelated.
- Check dirty tree; do not revert unrelated user changes. No worktree → stop before product edits unless user accepts risk. Check docs before dependency changes. Feature branch before code edits.
